cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, its measurements or its hardware evidence,
  please cite it as below. Every number in the documentation is backed by
  an evidence file and a reproduction command in VERIFIABLE-CLAIMS.md.
type: software
title: "AI Continuity Platform — Core (Vault Genome)"
abstract: >-
  Governance-first AI continuity: a fine-tuned model is sealed as a genome
  (the base model's hash, the sealed fine-tune delta and the deterministic
  recipe), released only to hardware that attests to an operator-signed
  policy, restored there behind a signed EXACT / EQUIVALENT / FAIL gate,
  and every decision is written to a signed, hash-chained audit log before
  it takes effect. Measured on AMD SEV-SNP, Intel TDX and NVIDIA H100
  confidential-computing hardware on GCP and Azure.
